ody who's engaged and  connected  people need to be prepared for all  different types of communication  situations be at a meeting be at a  presentation be it being an audience  member in in a presentation I encourage  everybody to go into any communication  event thinking about what are the key  questions I have that I want answers to  second what are the key points or themes  that I want to get across and with those  themes come up with some examples to  support them or to reinforce what you're  trying to get across if you go into any  communication situation with those  questions in mind and those themes in  your back pocket you will be able to  contribute more and ultimately take away  more from those situations  [Music]  you

